[05:03.48]advantage [ədˈvɑːntɪdʒ]n. 优势；利益；有利条件 v. 获利 例 The flrm has competitive advantage over its trading rivals. 搭 take advantage of 利用 / to sb.'s advantage 对某人有利
[05:19.08]avail [əˈveɪl]vt. 有助于，有利于 vi. 有帮助，有用，有 益 n. 效用；帮助；利益 例 It will avail his company to hire more staff. When Clarke's appointment was announced 搭 avail oneself of 利用 / to little avail 没有什 么用处 / to no avail 完全无用
[05:39.36]endow [ɪnˈdaʊ]vt. 捐助，捐赠基金给(学校、医院等)；给 予，赋予 例 The company endows a lot of equipment to the hospital. 搭 endow with 赋予
