[06:23.88]advisory [ədˈvaɪzəri]a. 顾问的，咨询的；劝告的 例 The department is set up to provide technical advisory services.
[06:34.56]evolve [iˈvɒlv]v. (使)演变，(使)进化；(使)发展 例 Trade talks can sometimes evolve into political dialogues. 搭 evolve into 演化成，发展成 better off 经济状况好的，富裕的 例 As a mat ter of fact, there are some individuals making themselves better off through the shift in the use of resources. 事实 上，有一些人通过转移利用中的资源，使自己富 裕起来。
[07:04.44]commodity [kəˈmɒdəti]n. 商品；日用品；货物 例 There is an abundance of commodity supplies on the market.
